## Interface: 16001
## Title: Forever Loot Sparkles
## Title-zhCN: 任务物品闪光
## Notes: Always shows the sparkle effect on lootable quest items. Switches the loot sparkle back on at login and whenever a graphics change resets it. Options under Options > AddOns.
## Notes-zhCN: 能拾取的任务物品一直闪光。矿、草药、尸体闪光默认关着，在 Esc → 选项 → 插件 里打开。
